# STAC Browser Directory

This directory should contain the Radiant Earth STAC Browser.

## Installation

Download the STAC Browser:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/radiantearth/stac-browser.git stac_browser
```

Or download a specific release from:
https://github.com/radiantearth/stac-browser/releases

**Note**: This directory is gitignored. Download separately.
